  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "How low with US petroleum reserves get to ease the price shock from the Iran war?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The US Strategic Petroleum Reserve as  of April 24th is 397.9 million barrels, down from 415 million pre-war.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "blockquote",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "text": "President Trump authorized the Department of Energy to release 172 million barrels from the Strategic Petroleum Reserve, beginning next week. This will take approximately 120 days to deliver based on planned discharge rates  ",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "text": "(",
         "type": "text",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "link",
           "attrs": {
